welcome to another thankful thursday i  believe it's important as entrepreneurs  to thank the people in your life who  have helped you with your business  because you can't do this alone and even  if it's just a friendly ear to talk to  sometimes that can make the difference  between you staying in business and and  quitting and going back in the job  so today i want to thank ed and ed is my  web host provider and it may be strange  to thank your web host provider but ed  has had a huge impact on my business  before i met ed and went with him  i was having a lot of problems with my  website  we were getting so much traffic that we  were crashing the servers it kept going  down i didn't know how to fix it you  know i'm not a technical person on the  server back end and i didn't understand  what the problem was i didn't know how  to fix it i only knew that my website  was down and when i called them i  couldn't understand what was happening  it's like this is my business my i need  my website up  i'm frustrated thinking back to that  time  and so i looked at different options and  i started talking to companies who were  known for their customer service and and  i was just underwhelmed and i wasn't  getting a great experience and i thought  man i don't want to have the same  process repeat over and over again so i  thought back to ed and ed i met at a  charity event that was helping  entrepreneurs in africa  and uh i gave a call and met up and i  thought you know what this guy seems to  care so i'm going to give him a shot  and from then on ed has been  amazing and he transferred everything  over to my new server he took care of  all the details he didn't charge me  extra for it he gives me recommendations  for improving it and making software  tweaks and he's up sometimes at three in  the morning on a friday night  doing silver upgrades  and the biggest thing that's been so  great is  my site has been up  right like i almost i don't think about  ed anymore which is just kind of sad but  but it's a good thing i don't think  about it because my site is up it works  everything is awesome and ed is  maintaining it and i don't need to talk  to him every week and say why is my site  not working  and so the biggest thing though is ed  cares  he cares he personally gets involved he  wants the person to make sure you're  happy he gets customer service he loves  what we're doing and he's become a part  of the team so ed for those of you who  could check out his website it's bounce  web if you need a good web host but  don't take up too much ed's time because  i still want to make sure  he's solid for my account so thank you  ed it's been awesome  you've had a huge impact on on my  business and just adding the stability  and your your friendliness and your  desire to help has just been amazing so  thank you and for those of you watching  and encourage you to take time today to  thank somebody who's had an impact on  your business make a video write them a  note send them an email go surprise them  with a cup of coffee and a donut  whatever it is just take a little bit of  time out of your day to say thank you  you know you'll feel better they'll feel  better everybody will have a better day  believe for those of you watching you  can subscribe to the channel  to see more videos like this you can  click on the link in the description to  support me and leave a comment let me  know what you think i love seeing those  comments come in they really make a  difference for me thank you so much i'll  see you soon
 

